{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "906cf5663363af401f7cfb6299dc059bd47d7fc7faa318f614c07c53869325bd", "ja": "アイドルの背中を押すために", "zh": "为了推偶像一把", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cafa468f654ff8778024ff67c7e3f4beb53239023a6c5e89c86b5b8190b4697c", "ja": "『竜宮小町』のデビューライブ当日。\n経験豊富にもかかわらず緊張しているメン\nバー達だが、「いつも通り」全責任を負うと\nいうプロデューサーへの信頼から調子を取り\n戻し、無事4人のステージが幕を開ける。", "zh": "『竜宮小町』的出道演唱会当天。\n尽管经验丰富，成员们仍然十分紧张，\n但由于信任制作人会像“平时一样”承担全部责任，她们恢复了状态，顺利拉开了由4人登台的演出序幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d15500830fdfe9da2cafe931dd621844fe3da3ab3ab2c1adf840be7c46ce1cb7", "ja": "（いよいよ『竜宮小町』としてのデビューライブ！\nとはいえ経験豊富なメンバーだ。今さら緊張など……）", "zh": "（终于要以“龙宫小町”的身份举办出道演唱会了！不过成员们都经验丰富，现在应该不会再紧张了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "43f8816d04fb715051bda9eddfd93fccc015d50a76a738610f2ce2cff6a33754", "ja": "すごい緊張してる！？　しかも全員……。\nみんな、どうしたんだ？　大丈夫か？", "zh": "好紧张！？而且还是全员……  \n大家这是怎么了？没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "53ddb4829c319871e2e08ee8aa5ab79f13a146383761ac678d593c5de55bd077", "ja": "あうあう、兄ちゃんヘルプ亜美～！\nなんかわかんないけど、めっちゃドキドキしてきた～！", "zh": "啊呜啊呜，哥哥快帮帮亚美～！\n虽然不知道怎么回事，但心跳得好快啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "bd677edca93927c13fc11d33b016a870a12894d3dfc9e6179066779a2ac52c91", "ja": "こ、困りました～。やっぱり、いつもとは\n少し違うユニットだからかしら……？", "zh": "这、这可麻烦了～。果然是因为这个组合和往常有些不同吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "d2e95918763fbcc8496c6b0b141b63207e1dd030c5995b645212b0d87728741b", "ja": "律子の緊張がうつったのっ。朝からずっとこの調子だ\nから、こっちまで……アンタ、なんとかしなさいよね！", "zh": "都是律子把紧张传染过来了啦。她从早上开始就一直是这个状态，连我也……你倒是快想想办法啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b1c41e9e00ad61ac21d8bd39093c3e1dd88061604aef50e3aea81d2a7dc0f6f5", "ja": "そうなのか、律子？", "zh": "是这样吗，律子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "86e95cf512810584f5588bac57a21f88a682059c6e8a4a6ab54b591c8a978581", "ja": "あはは……すみません。ステージが始まっちゃえば、\nどうにかなると思うんですけど……っ。", "zh": "啊哈哈……不好意思。只要舞台开始了，\n我觉得总会有办法的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "9b9bef26aa020c3399b0dd59d3cf28a7da67485c1fc97b833fe196693ebdba5e", "ja": "だって私にとってはプロデューサーデビューでもあって\nしかもよく考えたら、その反応を直接受けるわけで～！", "zh": "因为对我来说，这也是第一次当制作人，而且仔细想想，我还要直接面对大家的反应嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3758b6dcb81197f5ece1ad95662ab6517fb242da0cc92f1eab7e449fa6c62ed0", "ja": "なるほど……。確かに普通のプロデューサーは、\nステージでファンと直接、向き合うことはないからな。", "zh": "原来如此……确实，普通的制作人不会在舞台上直接面对粉丝啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "687f979b8c3dee825361cc0aeccc5051fb5319506d0fe033a8bfd66e64d6e3b6", "ja": "……よく考えたら、なんて恐ろしい……。\nすごいな律子！", "zh": "……仔细一想，真是太可怕了……\n律子，你真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "e86d0d125342528cb0b08a9f6bfe6c1e3b90360e033d2fefa0b1071d0d74a142", "ja": "「すごいな律子」じゃないですー！　感心してないで、\nなんとか励ましてください！　私と、みんなを！", "zh": "才不是“真厉害啊律子”呢——！别在那感叹了，\n快想想办法鼓励鼓励啊！鼓励我和大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "339bcee41e4012c6fe4930e176afbb830c27466c21541cabad5365ccaf4cbff6", "ja": "わ、わかった！\nえっと、そうだな……。みんな、聞いてくれ。", "zh": "好、好的！\n嗯，我想想……大家，听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f2e710b2a7b5e891cf4d38cb374d4af1da0604914383af9ba954d2f5d3693a50", "ja": "竜宮小町は律子が企画・プロデュースしたユニットだ。\nだから全責任は……律子にある。", "zh": "龙宫小町是律子策划并制作的组合。\n所以全部责任……都在律子身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "c47ac20db3f4114404823e7fe0f7136a1658e9cb9bdcb12ca47805581965e886", "ja": "いや鬼ですか！？\nいま、それを言いますか！？", "zh": "这也太魔鬼了吧！？\n现在说这个合适吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "47327212f6fbc3a9eee793fee51f4b1ea82f09c1c850203ddf0ac11273c12112", "ja": "でも、律子のプロデューサーはここにいるんだ。\nだから律子のステージの全責任は、その人物にある。", "zh": "但是，律子的制作人就在这里。\n所以，律子舞台的一切责任，都在那个人身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "06fce5ec7234b9b0a69fa0b34d637d6842354db224404bffd892f3183d764421", "ja": "って……。あれ？", "zh": "……等等。咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "11b1fc48ef26a22c05a5129cb517a6b8081cfcc8310085d259c4ddcf034a9dd8", "ja": "だからいつも通り、今まで通りだよ。\n最初から最後まで、ここで見てるから……。", "zh": "所以，就像平时一样，和过去一样。\n我会从头到尾一直在这里看着你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c5465b6d356daee13195f17435e845e54b7a718330d2d4fac5b7bf656535c7ef", "ja": "今まで積み重ねてきた輝きに、自信をもって。\n新しい輝きを、思いっきり解き放って来てくれ！", "zh": "请对一路积累至今的光辉抱有自信。\n去尽情释放全新的光辉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "760554a6aac149aca51c2a510ebfe58495334e53a24d9ef379e683d46640e76c", "ja": "……。ふふっ。\nはいっ、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "……呵呵。\n好的，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "a99b8745acec45c669f60800acb62be3de80893227cf4536a1f4c8ad6b423ebb", "ja": "はぁ……。なんだか、胸のつかえが\nスーッと下りました。さすがですね。", "zh": "哈啊……不知怎么的，心里的郁结一下子消散了。真不愧是您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "fbc6c9906a6c5aca0bbb52e349113e9e132c9bf4d1c1a1613275977bee7798a0", "ja": "プロデューサーって、アンタみたいにず太くないと\nダメなのね。律子、もうちょっとがんばりなさい♪", "zh": "制作人，不像你这么厚脸皮可是不行的呢。律子，再加把劲吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "885fee61e8158832cc98df91d434d9de834c77c95a962600e8a84cada359d856", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。\nおかげでみんな、自信が湧いてきたみたいです♪", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生。\n多亏了您，大家好像都涌起自信来了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "8fbaae2685367a57e07e6ed1ad3b2a62f08d89a167dd558efc0bfee1fb59d604", "ja": "見ててね、兄ちゃん！　竜宮小町のお披露目ステージ！\nみんなで一緒に、思いっきり楽しんでくんねー！", "zh": "你看好咯，哥哥！龙宫小町的首演舞台！\n大家一起，尽情享受吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ce698ffcd797b7a6ec3fdd4b6187080bc8c349bff04a3d35a269e08d453a2173", "ja": "うん、俺も楽しませてもらうよ。\n……さあ、そろそろ時間だな。行こう！", "zh": "嗯，我也很期待好好享受一番。\n……好了，差不多到时间了。走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_06_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
